# Note: .h5 and .npy files are NOT gitignored because they
# fit within Streamlit Cloud's 1GB deployment limit.
# Total size: ~102 MB (.h5: 91.5 MB + .npy: 10 MB)
# If deploying elsewhere, consider Git LFS for these files.
